# Cargo build output
/target

# Smoke-test artifacts (raw PCM dumps + helper stderr). *.log is already
# covered by the top-level cheating-daddy/.gitignore; we widen *.raw here
# so any debug capture (capture.raw, test1.raw, debug-44k.raw, etc.) is
# safe to leave in the workspace without leaking into the repo. Codex
# review caught the previous `capture*.raw` glob missing test1/test2/test3.
*.raw
*.stderr.log
